Sorted by name, __name__ included:
[('__name__','http_requests_count'),('env','dev'),('region','eu')]	Array(Tuple(String, String))
Only the tags array, no separate pairs:
[('a','1'),('b','2')]
Empty and NULL tags array:
[]	[]	[]
[('__name__','http_requests_total')]	[('__name__','http_requests_total'),('region','us')]
An empty value or a NULL value means the tag is absent:
[('__name__','http_requests_total')]	[('__name__','http_requests_total')]	[('__name__','x')]	[('region','eu')]
An empty separate value does not conflict with the same tag in the array:
[('__name__','bar'),('x','1')]
A duplicate tag with the same value is removed, with a different value is an error:
[('job','api')]
[('job','api')]
Map:
[('__name__','http_requests_count'),('env','dev'),('region','eu')]
